title: Close archive subscriptions and stop canceled storage work
doc:
- audience:
  - Node Dev
  - Node Operator
  description: |-
    Fix archive_v1_storage and archive_v1_storageDiff subscription lifecycle handling.
    Unsubscribing or disconnecting now releases bounded forwarding channels and stops
    subsequent storage scans, query items and trie groups at cooperative cancellation
    boundaries. Notifications waiting for outgoing queue capacity also observe
    subscription closure, including early error paths. An already-running synchronous
    backend operation is allowed to finish.

    Completed storageDiff subscriptions now close after their terminal event instead
    of retaining an extra sender. RPC method names, parameters and event order remain
    compatible. Node operators adopt the fix through a node binary update; no runtime
    upgrade or database migration is required.
crates:
- name: sc-rpc-spec-v2
  bump: patch
